  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IcRlkcNt/images/2070e0d9ddc7294bcd2af1ede04fd4d86d000367.jpeg\" alt=\"城市紋理包標頭\"></p><h1>城市紋理包</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcity-texture-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"模組平台\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub贊助\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi贊助\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a></p><p>釋放你內心的建築師，塑造你周圍的世界。</p><p>此紋理包添加了一組創意紋理，非常適合用於建築物建造。包含方塊、物品、實體及UI的獨特紋理。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IcRlkcNt/images/ddaf24fe6383c149e9a86d66cc4e68d8cd4ec670.jpeg\" alt=\"世界預覽\"></p><hr><p>此資源包是將《城市紋理包》從Legacy Console Edition移植而來，並更新了Bedrock Edition的紋理。原始紋理由4J Studios製作。</p>",
